teachingContent.beginner:
**CSS** (Cascading Style Sheets) styles HTML elements.

**CSS Syntax:**
```css
selector {
    property: value;
}
```

**Adding CSS:**
```html
<!-- Inline -->
<p style="color: blue;">Text</p>

<!-- Internal -->
<style>
    p { color: blue; }
</style>

<!-- External (recommended) -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
```

**Basic Selectors:**
```css
/* Element */
p { color: blue; }

/* Class */
.button { background: red; }

/* ID */
#header { font-size: 24px; }
```

teachingContent.intermediate:
Advanced selectors and specificity:

**Combinators:**
```css
/* Descendant */
div p { color: blue; }

/* Child */
div > p { color: red; }

/* Adjacent sibling */
h1 + p { margin-top: 0; }

/* General sibling */
h1 ~ p { color: gray; }
```

**Pseudo-classes:**
```css
a:hover { color: red; }
a:visited { color: purple; }
input:focus { border: 2px solid blue; }
li:first-child { font-weight: bold; }
li:nth-child(2n) { background: #f0f0f0; }
```

**Specificity:**
- Inline: 1000
- ID: 100
- Class: 10
- Element: 1

teachingContent.advanced:
Advanced selectors:

**Attribute Selectors:**
```css
[type="text"] { border: 1px solid gray; }
[href^="https"] { color: green; }
[href$=".pdf"] { color: red; }
[class*="btn"] { padding: 10px; }
```

**Pseudo-elements:**
```css
p::first-line { font-weight: bold; }
p::first-letter { font-size: 2em; }
.button::before { content: "→ "; }
.button::after { content: " ←"; }
```

teachingContent.intermediate:
Box model properties:

**Margin and Padding:**
```css
/* All sides */
margin: 10px;

/* Top/Bottom, Left/Right */
margin: 10px 20px;

/* Top, Right, Bottom, Left */
margin: 10px 20px 30px 40px;

/* Individual sides */
margin-top: 10px;
margin-right: 20px;
```

**Box Sizing:**
```css
/* Default: width doesn't include padding/border */
box-sizing: content-box;

/* Better: width includes padding/border */
box-sizing: border-box;

/* Apply to all elements */
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}
```

teachingContent.advanced:
Advanced box model:

**Margin Collapse:**
```css
/* Vertical margins collapse */
.box1 { margin-bottom: 20px; }
.box2 { margin-top: 30px; }
/* Actual gap: 30px (not 50px) */
```

**Overflow:**
```css
.container {
    overflow: hidden;  /* Hide overflow */
    overflow: scroll;  /* Always show scrollbar */
    overflow: auto;    /* Show scrollbar when needed */
}
```

teachingContent.beginner:
**Flexbox** makes layouts easy!

**Basic Flexbox:**
```css
.container {
    display: flex;
}
```

**Flex Direction:**
```css
.row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;  /* Default: left to right */
}

.column {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;  /* Top to bottom */
}
```

**Justify Content (Main Axis):**
```css
.container {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;        /* Center */
    justify-content: space-between; /* Space between items */
    justify-content: space-around;  /* Space around items */
}
```

teachingContent.intermediate:
Advanced flexbox properties:

**Align Items (Cross Axis):**
```css
.container {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;      /* Center vertically */
    align-items: flex-start;  /* Top */
    align-items: flex-end;    /* Bottom */
    align-items: stretch;     /* Stretch to fill */
}
```

**Flex Items:**
```css
.item {
    flex: 1;  /* Grow to fill space */
    flex: 0 0 200px;  /* Don't grow/shrink, 200px wide */
}

/* Shorthand for: */
flex-grow: 1;
flex-shrink: 1;
flex-basis: 0;
```

**Flex Wrap:**
```css
.container {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;  /* Wrap to next line */
}
```

teachingContent.advanced:
Advanced flexbox patterns:

**Align Self:**
```css
.item {
    align-self: flex-end;  /* Override container's align-items */
}
```

**Order:**
```css
.item1 { order: 2; }
.item2 { order: 1; }  /* Appears first */
.item3 { order: 3; }
```

**Gap:**
```css
.container {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;  /* Space between items */
    row-gap: 10px;
    column-gap: 20px;
}
```

teachingContent.beginner:
**CSS Grid** creates 2D layouts.

**Basic Grid:**
```css
.container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 200px 200px 200px;
    grid-template-rows: 100px 100px;
    gap: 20px;
}
```

**Fractional Units (fr):**
```css
.container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr 1fr;
    /* 1 part, 2 parts, 1 part */
}
```

**Repeat:**
```css
.container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    /* Same as: 1fr 1fr 1fr */
}
```

teachingContent.intermediate:
Advanced grid features:

**Grid Areas:**
```css
.container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-areas:
        "header header header"
        "sidebar main main"
        "footer footer footer";
}

.header { grid-area: header; }
.sidebar { grid-area: sidebar; }
.main { grid-area: main; }
.footer { grid-area: footer; }
```

**Grid Lines:**
```css
.item {
    grid-column: 1 / 3;  /* Span columns 1-3 */
    grid-row: 1 / 2;     /* Span rows 1-2 */
}

/* Shorthand */
.item {
    grid-area: 1 / 1 / 2 / 3;
    /* row-start / col-start / row-end / col-end */
}
```

teachingContent.advanced:
Advanced grid techniques:

**Auto-fit and Auto-fill:**
```css
.container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    /* Responsive grid without media queries! */
}
```

**Grid Auto Flow:**
```css
.container {
    display: grid;
    grid-auto-flow: dense;  /* Fill gaps */
}
```

**Implicit Grid:**
```css
.container {
    display: grid;
    grid-auto-rows: 100px;  /* Auto-created rows */
}
```

teachingContent.beginner:
**Responsive Design** makes sites work on all devices.

**Viewport Meta Tag:**
```html
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
```

**Media Queries:**
```css
/* Mobile first (default) */
.container {
    width: 100%;
}

/* Tablet */
@media (min-width: 768px) {
    .container {
        width: 750px;
    }
}

/* Desktop */
@media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .container {
        width: 1000px;
    }
}
```

teachingContent.intermediate:
Advanced responsive techniques:

**Responsive Images:**
```css
img {
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
}
```

**Responsive Typography:**
```css
html {
    font-size: 16px;
}

@media (min-width: 768px) {
    html {
        font-size: 18px;
    }
}

/* Or use clamp() */
html {
    font-size: clamp(14px, 2vw, 20px);
}
```

**Breakpoints:**
```css
/* Mobile: < 768px */
/* Tablet: 768px - 1024px */
/* Desktop: > 1024px */
```

teachingContent.advanced:
Modern responsive techniques:

**Container Queries:**
```css
@container (min-width: 400px) {
    .card {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    }
}
```

**Fluid Typography:**
```css
h1 {
    font-size: calc(1.5rem + 2vw);
}
```

**Aspect Ratio:**
```css
.video {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
}
```
